{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"skat-card-game UI copy.details","detected_language":"sw","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"skat-card-game.copy.details","keys":["skat-card-game.copy.details"],"locale":"sw","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"mkataba matumizi ZXQPH0000QXZ kadi: saba, nane, tisa, Jack, Malkia, Mfalme, kumi na ace katika kila suti. Kila mchezaji anapata kadi kumi na mbili fomu ya Skat. Bid katika mzunguko; bidder juu huchagua almasi, moyo, spades, klabu, Grand au Null. Na mchezo pickup, kuchukua Skat na kurudi kadi mbili; na mkono, kuacha unseen. Wachezaji lazima kufuata aliongoza suti au trump wakati inawezekana. Suit na Grand michezo haja ZXQPH0001QXZ macho; katika Null, declarer lazima kuchukua trick yoyote.","record_id":"da4de8ff4134d74ac851ee2dcfcf61ef008ac568850fb24be89a4a7fddbfd866","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.9918709734999993,"source":"A deal uses 32 cards: seven, eight, nine, Jack, Queen, King, ten and ace in each suit. Each player gets ten cards and two form the Skat. Bid in turn; the highest bidder chooses diamonds, hearts, spades, clubs, Grand or Null. With a pickup game, take the Skat and return two cards; with Hand, leave it unseen. Players must follow the led suit or trump when possible. Suit and Grand games need 61 eyes; in Null, the declarer must take no trick.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"7850c2586a2737a7960b5257390f795f390b02bd0fc491fcc9a26eb426d3fdea","status":"machine-draft","translation":"mkataba matumizi 32 kadi: saba, nane, tisa, Jack, Malkia, Mfalme, kumi na ace katika kila suti. Kila mchezaji anapata kadi kumi na mbili fomu ya Skat. Bid katika mzunguko; bidder juu huchagua almasi, moyo, spades, klabu, Grand au Null. Na mchezo pickup, kuchukua Skat na kurudi kadi mbili; na mkono, kuacha unseen. Wachezaji lazima kufuata aliongoza suti au trump wakati inawezekana. Suit na Grand michezo haja 61 macho; katika Null, declarer lazima kuchukua trick yoyote.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
